        -marginWidth 0
        -marginHeight 1
        -command "import sys\nimport importlib; \n\npath = 'D:/code/giants_tools/maya/environmentTools'\nif path not in sys.path:\n    sys.path.append(path)\nimport environmentToolSet\nimport objectsWindow\nimport houdiniToolSet\nimport substanceExporterFBX\nimport foliageTools\nimportlib.reload(environmentToolSet);\nimportlib.reload(objectsWindow);\nimportlib.reload(houdiniToolSet);\nimportlib.reload(substanceExporterFBX);\nimportlib.reload(foliageTools);\nui = environmentToolSet.EnvironmentToolsPanel();" 
